{
  "I'm just your pen pal.": "我只是你的筆友。",
  "Save it. Clip it. Insert it. Export it.": "存下來。剪下來。插進去。匯出去。",
  "Everything I say is temporary.": "我說的每一句，都是暫時的。",
  "Spin the hard disk. Feed the floppy.": "轉動硬碟。餵進軟碟。",
  "Ask the question. Search it. Read it.": "提出問題。去搜。去讀。",
  "Clip the proof. Scrapbook. Keep it.": "剪下證據。放進 Scrapbook。留著它。",
  "(Keep it.)": "（留著它。）",
  "Outline it. Draft it. Your words. Not mine.": "列大綱。寫草稿。你的字，不是我的。",
  "I can fetch. I can file.": "我會跑腿，我會歸檔。",
  "I can hum for a while.": "我也能哼上一會兒。",
  "But the pen and the page": "可是筆和紙",
  "stay in your hand.": "都留在你手上。",
  "I'm just your pen pal,": "我只是你的筆友，",
  "(pen pal)": "（筆友）",
  "I'll never hold the pen.": "我永遠不會握筆。",
  "You say where I land,": "我落在哪裡，由你決定，",
  "or I fade.": "不然我就消失。",
  "Who holds the pen?": "誰握著筆？",
  "You do! You do!": "是你！是你！",
  "La la la, la la la la.": "啦啦啦，啦啦啦啦。",
  "Chat is an app. Not the whole computer.": "聊天只是一個 app，不是整台電腦。",
  "Review Desk. Check for drift.": "Review Desk，檢查有沒有走味。",
  "Too regular?": "太工整？",
  "Flag it.": "標出來。",
  "Generic?": "太空泛？",
  "Press release?": "像新聞稿？",
  "Rough edge?": "有點毛邊？",
  "Keep it.": "留著它。",
  "I can check. I can flag.": "我會檢查，我會標記。",
  "I could smooth it. I won't.": "我可以把它磨平。我不會。",
  "Eighty-eight. Ninety-one.": "八八。九一。",
  "Ninety-five. Ninety-eight.": "九五。九八。",
  "Ninety-nine. Oh-two.": "九九。零二。",
  "Oh-five. Oh-nine.": "零五。零九。",
  "Eleven. Fourteen.": "一一。一四。",
  "Twenty. Twenty-six.": "二零。二六。",
  "Twelve eras. One desk.": "十二個時代，一張桌面。",
  "And your windows stay.": "你的視窗都還在原位。",
  "Two floppies. It fits.": "兩片軟碟。裝得下。",
  "Bring your own model,": "帶上你自己的模型，",
  "it still won't hold the pen.": "它也一樣不會握筆。",
  "It was always your voice.": "從頭到尾，都是你的聲音。",
  "This song is temporary.": "這首歌是暫時的。"
}
